                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The purpose of this letter is to confirm the understanding reached between the parties during the 1997 contract negotiations in regards to the welder classification.",
            "block_bbox": [
                94,
                142,
                675,
                186
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    94.0,
                    142.0
                ],
                [
                    675.0,
                    142.0
                ],
                [
                    675.0,
                    186.0
                ],
                [
                    94.0,
                    186.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The parties agree to the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                95,
                207,
                352,
                231
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    95.0,
                    207.0
                ],
                [
                    352.0,
                    207.0
                ],
                [
                    352.0,
                    231.0
                ],
                [
                    95.0,
                    231.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Company will immediately place the two incumbent employees currently doing welding work into this classification at the general fitter rate of pay.",
            "block_bbox": [
                96,
                243,
                676,
                311
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    96.0,
                    243.0
                ],
                [
                    676.0,
                    243.0
                ],
                [
                    676.0,
                    311.0
                ],
                [
                    96.0,
                    311.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. By March 30, 1998, to have the two (2) incumbent welders fully trained.",
            "block_bbox": [
                93,
                323,
                654,
                345
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    93.0,
                    323.0
                ],
                [
                    654.0,
                    323.0
                ],
                [
                    654.0,
                    345.0
                ],
                [
                    93.0,
                    345.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The third welding position will be filled six (6) months after the signing of the contract. The third welder, if hired from outside the Company, will be paid the welder/general fitter rate of pay as of the first day of employment.",
            "block_bbox": [
                94,
                359,
                675,
                427
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    94.0,
                    359.0
                ],
                [
                    675.0,
                    359.0
                ],
                [
                    675.0,
                    427.0
                ],
                [
                    94.0,
                    427.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. A separate overtime list will be established for the welders, however, after the overtime list has been exhausted in Distribution and all employees have been asked to work (includes weekdays, weekends, holidays) and a need for an additional employee(s) is required, qualified welders will be asked to work.",
            "block_bbox": [
                92,
                439,
                675,
                549
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    92.0,
                    439.0
                ],
                [
                    675.0,
                    439.0
                ],
                [
                    675.0,
                    549.0
                ],
                [
                    92.0,
                    549.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. The welder classification will be classified as a skilled trade under Article XII and Article XI.",
            "block_bbox": [
                93,
                563,
                673,
                607
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    93.0,
                    563.0
                ],
                [
                    673.0,
                    563.0
                ],
                [
                    673.0,
                    607.0
                ],
                [
                    93.0,
                    607.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. When welding work is not available, the employee shall be required to perform the duties listed in the general fitter classification. In the event of lack of work, the employee/employees will be assigned by the lowest Distribution Department seniority to perform those duties.",
            "block_bbox": [
                92,
                620,
                673,
                709
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    92.0,
                    620.0
                ],
                [
                    673.0,
                    620.0
                ],
                [
                    673.0,
                    709.0
                ],
                [
                    92.0,
                    709.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7. Incumbent welders may exercise their rights under the Collective Bargaining Agreement to return to their former classification within 90 days of February 9, 1998.",
            "block_bbox": [
                93,
                721,
                672,
                788
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    93.0,
                    721.0
                ],
                [
                    672.0,
                    721.0
                ],
                [
                    672.0,
                    788.0
                ],
                [
                    93.0,
                    788.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. Carharts, if damaged beyond repair, will be replaced. However, no more than one (1) replacement will be allowed during the contract.",
            "block_bbox": [
                92,
                801,
                671,
                846
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 12,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    92.0,
